      55.25,
      645.22,
      549.78,
      669.29
    ],
    "text": "The Control of Pesticides Regulations (Sales and Supply), No. 01 of 1999 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1113/15 of January 5,2000 are hereby further amended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      684.22,
      547.31,
      695.29
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the substitution for paragraph (c) of the sub regulation (5) of the regulation 2 thereof of the following paragraph: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      710.22,
      316.04,
      721.29
    ],
    "text": "\u2018\u2018(c) be accompanied by a fee of Rupees Two Thousand.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      84.31,
      508.56,
      108.67
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2024'08'09PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.08.2024 2A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
