      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      126.97,
      462.03,
      138.04
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the addition immediately after the regulation 2 thereof, of the following new regulations:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.97,
      152.97,
      542.51,
      177.04
    ],
    "text": "\u201c2A. (1) Every application for renewal of the certi\ufb01 cate for sale made after twelve months from the date of its issue shall be accompanied by a fee of Rupees Five Thousand for each late year.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.97,
      191.97,
      542.54,
      216.04
    ],
    "text": "(2) Every application for training of Agrochemical Sales and Technical Assistant shall be accompanied by a fee of Rupees Two Hundred; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.97,
      230.97,
      542.51,
      255.04
    ],
    "text": "(3) Every person eligible for training for Agrochemical Sales and Technical Assistant shall pay Rupees Five Thousand.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.97,
      269.97,
      542.51,
      294.04
    ],
    "text": "(4) Every appication for renewal of the training certi\ufb01 cate of Agrochemical Sales and Technical Assistant after three years of its issue shall be payable of Rupees Two Thousand.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
